<title>VENEZUELA: Electricidad de Caracas Q1 net soars.</title>
<headline>Electricidad de Caracas Q1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 14.0 bln bolivars vs 6.1 bln bolivar loss</p>
<p>Sales 53.1 bln bolivars vs 61.6 bln</p>
<p>Operating costs 43.3 bln bolivars vs 40.3 bln</p>
<p>Operating profit 11.2 bln bolivars vs 22.0 bln</p>
<p>Net financing gain 3.1 bln bolivars vs 18.3 bln bolivar loss</p>
<p>Notes: Period ends March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Results are consolidated, and expressed in constant March 31 1997 bolivars</p>
<p>CA La Electricidad de Caracas is the market leader on the Caracas stock exchange and chief energy supplier to the capital</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
